{# [callout type="note"] ... [/callout]

   `note` (cyan), `warn` (gold) and `good` (mint). An unknown type falls back to
   `note` rather than rendering an unstyled box, because a typo in a shortcode
   attribute should not silently change how a paragraph reads. #}
{% set kind = type if type in ["note", "warn", "good"] else "note" %}
<div class="callout callout-{{ kind }}">{{ content | safe }}</div>
